# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator-issued token:** The role mints a Gitea personal access token named ``gitea-mcp`` for the ``administrator`` account with the read-only scope set ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, and persists it in the token store MCP clients read. Every deploy asks the API whether the stored token still authenticates, revokes the stale entry under that name, and re-mints when the API rejects it. The deploy fails if the fresh token is rejected too."
msgstr "**Token dari Administrator:** Peran memainkan Gitea Tanda akses pribadi bernama ``gitea-mcp`` untuk ``administrator`` akun dengan set baca-saja scope ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, dan tetap di toko token MCP klien membaca. Setiap menyebarkan bertanya API apakah token yang disimpan masih otentikasi, membatalkan entri basi di bawah nama itu, dan re-mints ketika API Menolaknya. Pengiriman gagal jika tanda baru ditolak juga."

