msgid "**Break-glass path:** with ``is_email_auth_allowed`` off, Fider keeps an administrator bypass on the sign-in modal (“If you have an administrator account … click here”): it reveals the email form, and Fider sends a sign-in code only to an account with the administrator role, so the platform administrator signs in with the code from its mailbox while Keycloak is unavailable."
