msgid "**Break-glass:** With ``native`` off, no account signs in with a password on the web, ``root`` included. The local administrator re-enables the form from the Rails console of the ``webservice`` container (``/srv/gitlab/bin/rails runner \"Gitlab::CurrentSettings.update!(password_authentication_enabled_for_web: true)\"``), or the inventory sets ``services.gitlab.login.method.native.enabled: true`` and redeploys; the next deploy converges the setting back to the inventory value. The design specs sign the platform administrator in through Keycloak while the form is off."
