# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable state defaults to off; deliberately-wired integrations auto-enable with their partner.** `enabled` is optional and defaults to `false` unless `required: true` is set. An addon that bridges a service MUST derive its effective enablement from that service's `enabled` flag (never a duplicated group-membership expression), so a deliberately-wired cross-role integration activates automatically whenever its partner role is co-deployed (`services.<target>.enabled` is true) and stays off otherwise. Any credential an addon needs is declared in `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Decision 4): auto-generated where possible, or supplied through the same credentials mechanism's manual-entry path where the operator must enter the secret. There is no separate opt-in exception: auto-enable-with-partner holds, and an operator-entered credential resolves through `credentials` like any other. This auto-enable-with-partner rule is distinct from update-automation-discovered addons (Decision 10), which are added hard-off."
msgstr "**Aktifkan baku keadaan untuk mati; musyawarah-integrasinya terkabel otomatis-aktifkan dengan pasangan mereka.** `enabled` adalah opsional dan baku ke `false` kecuali `required: true` Sudah diatur. Addon yang menjembatani layanan Harus mendapatkan yang efektif dari layanan yang `enabled` tanda (tidak pernah sebuah ekspresi grup-keanggotaan ganda), sehingga yang musyawarah-kabel integrasi garis-kabel diaktifkan secara otomatis ketika peran pasangannya adalah ko- dikerahkan (`services.<target>.enabled` benar) dan tetap off sebaliknya. Setiap kredensial dan kebutuhan addon dideklarasikan di `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` dan membaca melalui `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Keputusan 4): auto- dihasilkan dimana mungkin, atau diberikan melalui mekanisme kredensial sama manual-jalur masukan dimana operator harus memasukkan rahasia. Tidak ada opsi terpisah -dalam pengecualian: auto-enable -with-partner berlaku, dan sebuah operasi -entered credential memecahkan melalui `credentials` seperti yang lainnya. Aturan auto-enable-with-partner berbeda dari update- otomatis-ditemukan addon (Keputusan 10), yang ditambahkan keras-off."

