msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-statement chains in shell invocations are FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NOT chain independent statements inside a single Bash tool call with **any** statement separator (`;`, literal newline, `&&`, `||`, `&` background operator, or subshell/brace groups around the same). The ban covers causally-dependent chains (`cd X && cmd`) just as much as optional ones, and applies to trailing `&` used to background a command (use the Bash tool's `run_in_background: true` parameter instead). Reason: identical to the loop rule. Split the work across **separate Bash tool calls** or use a single-command equivalent (`xargs`, `grep` with multiple args, a make target)."
msgstr "**Pernyataan rantai multi- dalam doa shell dilarang. ⛔** Anda HARUS TIDAK rantai pernyataan independen dalam satu perangkat Bash panggilan dengan **sebarang** pernyataan pemisah (`;`, literal newline, `&&`, `||`, `&` operator latar belakang, atau grup subshell / brace sekitar sama). Larangan menutup rantai yang tergantung. (`cd X && cmd`) sama seperti yang opsional, dan berlaku untuk trailing `&` digunakan untuk latar belakang perintah (gunakan alat Bash `run_in_background: true` parameter sebagai gantinya)Alasan: identik dengan aturan loop. Pecah pekerjaan di seluruh **panggilan perangkat Bash terpisah** atau gunakan sebuah perintah tunggal ekuivalen (`xargs`, `grep` dengan beberapa args, sebuah membuat target)."

msgid "**Multi-vhost call patterns:** loops with `loop_var: domain` in mastodon `00_core.yml:6`, peertube `:6`, wordpress `:10`, joomla `:4`; list loops in minio `:21`, seaweedfs `:40`; several explicit calls in bluesky `:58/67/88`, matrix compose `04_webserver.yml:8,17` and ansible flavor `06_proxy_wiring.yml:132,140,161`; `web-svc-html :8` and `web-svc-file :8` call it inside a `name: \"{{ item }}\"` loop together with dev-git; stalwart `:90` and `web-svc-cdn :19` call front-proxy in addition to full; confluence, jira and xwiki wrap full in a block guarded by `run_once_<role>`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-wall**: declare multiple purpose-built walls (per event, hashtag, account set, …) under one deployment."
msgstr "**Dinding Multi-**: mendeklarasikan ganda tujuan-dibangun dinding (per acara, tagar, rekening ditetapkan,...) di bawah satu penyebaran."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multisite Management:** Easily create and maintain multiple sites with a single WordPress installation, ideal for networks of blogs, corporate intranets, or educational institutions."
msgstr "**Manajemen Multisite:** Mudah membuat dan mempertahankan beberapa situs dengan tunggal WordPress instalasi, ideal untuk jaringan blog, intranet perusahaan, atau lembaga pendidikan."

msgid "**Multisite RBAC:** Under Multisite, per-site groups set the role on each site, and the network-administrator group grants super-admin and revokes the super-admin rights it granted. The bootstrap administrator keeps its super-admin rights."
msgstr ""

# `is_multisite()`): peran per- situs berasal
# `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<canonical-domain>/<role>` masukan; kemampuan
# super- admin berasal dari `/roles/web-app-wordpress/network-administrator`.
# Mapper menambahkan pengguna untuk setiap situs mereka memiliki peran untuk
# (`add_user_to_blog`) dan Kami usir mereka (dari negeri mereka),
# (`remove_user_from_blog`) ketika peran untuk situs itu menghilang dari
# klaim. Penanda meta (`_infinito_oidc_added_blog_ids`) catatan mana blog yang
# keanggotaan mapper memiliki, sehingga keanggotaan ditambahkan melalui
# `wp-admin` atau REST API Di luar aliran OIDC tidak pernah tersentuh.
msgid "**Multisite path** (auto-detected via `is_multisite()`): per-site roles come from `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<canonical-domain>/<role>` entries; the super-admin capability comes from `/roles/web-app-wordpress/network-administrator`. The mapper adds the user to any site they have a role for (`add_user_to_blog`) and removes them from sites it previously added them to (`remove_user_from_blog`) when a role for that site disappears from the claim. A user-meta marker (`_infinito_oidc_added_blog_ids`) records which blog memberships the mapper owns, so memberships added through `wp-admin` or the REST API outside the OIDC flow are never touched."
msgstr ""

