msgid "**Refusals are counted on their own axis.** An engine whose answer is rejected is neither unreachable like decision 13's failures nor worse like decision 8's lost comparisons: it is unsuited to that pair. The three counts are stored separately so decision 5's criteria line can say which of the three happened, and so a pair an engine keeps mangling steers the next decision away from it without that engine losing standing on the pairs it serves well."
