# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restricted engine access:** The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume shared with the socket proxy, which publishes no port and runs with ``network_mode: none`` in compose. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. It filters methods and paths, not request bodies: ``volumes/create`` stays open for the per-agent volume, so the isolation holds against a compromised agent, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised broker."
msgstr "**Akses mesin terbatas:** Broker mencapai mesin kontainer hanya melalui soket unix disaring dalam volume bersama dengan proksi soket, yang mempublikasikan tidak ada port dan berjalan dengan ``network_mode: none`` dalam komposisi. Proksi hanya mengakui kontainer, layanan, tugas, jaringan, volume dan citra yang dibuat oleh pialang, dan menolak setiap metode dan path lainnya, termasuk exec dan delete. Ini filter metode dan jalan, tidak meminta tubuh: ``volumes/create`` tetap terbuka untuk volume per- agen, sehingga isolasi memegang terhadap agen dikompromikan, yang mencapai tidak ada soket sama sekali, tidak terhadap broker dikompromikan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restricted engine access:** The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume shared with the socket proxy, which publishes no port and runs with `network_mode: none` in compose. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. It filters methods and paths, not request bodies: `volumes/create` stays open for the per-agent volume, so the isolation holds against a compromised agent, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised broker."
msgstr "**Akses mesin terbatas:** Broker mencapai mesin kontainer hanya melalui soket unix disaring dalam volume bersama dengan proksi soket, yang mempublikasikan tidak ada port dan berjalan dengan `network_mode: none` dalam komposisi. Proksi hanya mengakui kontainer, layanan, tugas, jaringan, volume dan citra yang dibuat oleh pialang, dan menolak setiap metode dan path lainnya, termasuk exec dan delete. Ini filter metode dan jalan, tidak meminta tubuh: `volumes/create` tetap terbuka untuk volume per- agen, sehingga isolasi memegang terhadap agen dikompromikan, yang mencapai tidak ada soket sama sekali, tidak terhadap broker dikompromikan."

msgid "**Restricted project:** ``agents-<instance>`` allows unprivileged instances only, pool-managed disks only (no host path), managed network cards on the agent bridge only and no low-level VM options."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted project:** `agents-<instance>` allows unprivileged instances only, pool-managed disks only (no host path), managed network cards on the agent bridge only and no low-level VM options."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted sign-in:** Only members of the ``administrator`` and ``user`` role groups pass the oauth2-proxy gate (``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups``) and the LDAP ``filter_string`` of the auth source."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted sign-in:** Only members of the `administrator` and `user` role groups pass the oauth2-proxy gate (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`) and the LDAP `filter_string` of the auth source."
