msgid "**Shared platform team:** Penpot has no instance administrator, only roles per team, so the role groups map onto one team named after `ORGANIZATION` that the platform administrator owns: `administrator` members are team admins, `editor` members editors and `viewer` members viewers; a profile outside all three leaves the team the way Penpot's own leave does. [files/sql/rbac/reconcile.sql](./files/sql/rbac/reconcile.sql) runs in the database as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer; it creates the team once the administrator's profile exists and matches members by e-mail, so a member joins on the first run after their first sign-in."
