msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor = compose sidecar**, `network_mode: host`, keys on a named volume, restored from the vaulted mint **before** Tor starts. Backup via `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."
msgstr "**Tor = gerbong samping compose**, `network_mode: host`, kunci pada volume bernama, dipulihkan dari mint berkubah **sebelum** Tor mulai. Backup via `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."

msgid "**Tor and direct lists:** ``egress.tor`` and ``egress.direct`` each carry an ``include`` and an ``except``; entries are host names, ``*.`` wildcards, IPs and CIDRs. A host name covers its subdomains, so ``example.org`` and ``*.example.org`` mean the same. ``except`` only narrows its own ``include``, a destination both lists keep takes Tor, and the route decides everything no list matches. ``.onion`` can never be direct."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Tor and direct lists:** `egress.tor` and `egress.direct` each carry an `include` and an `except`; entries are host names, `*.` wildcards, IPs and CIDRs. A host name covers its subdomains, so `example.org` and `*.example.org` mean the same. `except` only narrows its own `include`, a destination both lists keep takes Tor, and the route decides everything no list matches. `.onion` can never be direct."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor as a first-class deployment axis.** The new *svc-net-tor* role routes onion names through Tor via DNS instead of per-app proxies, offers a chutney flavor for private-net test deployments, and ties its dnsmasq listener to ownership rather than the deploy mode. Applications follow: server-side OIDC discovery and token exchange reach plaintext onion issuers through the SOCKS proxy (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), session cookies drop the *Secure* flag where an onion cannot carry it (Taiga, Pixelfed, Joomla), and mail authenticates on the submission port the onion relay actually serves. The deploy matrix gained a tor axis with an onion marker plus enforced and exclusive modes, and lint now requires the onion in every variant. See the [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) README."
msgstr "**Tor sebagai sumbu penyebaran kelas pertama.** Baru *svc-net-tor* rute peran nama bawang melalui Tor melalui DNS bukan proksi per- app, menawarkan rasa chutney untuk pelaksanaan tes privatet- net, dan menghubungkan pendengar Dnssq nya untuk kepemilikan daripada mode menyebarkan. Aplikasi mengikuti: penemuan OIDC sisi server dan pertukaran token mencapai penerbit bawang biasa melalui proksi SOCKS (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), sesi cookies drop yang *Aman* bendera di mana bawang tidak dapat membawanya (Taiga, Pixelfed, Joomla), dan surat otentikasi pada pengiriman port relay bawang sebenarnya berfungsi. Matriks menyebarkan memperoleh sumbu tor dengan penanda bawang ditambah mode yang dipaksakan dan eksklusif, dan benang sekarang membutuhkan bawang di setiap varian. Lihat [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) README."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor image built via `files/Dockerfile`** from a pinned Debian `tor` package (`deb.debian.org`; no sandbox-allowlist change). `deb.torproject.org` = documented alternative requiring an allowlist entry."
msgstr "**Tor image built via `files/Dockerfile`** dari Debian yang disematkan `tor` paket (`deb.debian.org`; tidak ada sandbox- allowlist berubah). `deb.torproject.org` = didokumentasikan alternatif yang membutuhkan entri allowlist."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor-ready:** ``svc-net-tor`` depends on this service, so onion deployments serve all whitelisted third-party assets from the onion itself."
msgstr "**Tor- siap:** ``svc-net-tor`` tergantung pada layanan ini, sehingga pengiriman bawang melayani semua Whitelisted aset pihak ketiga dari bawang itu sendiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor-ready:** `svc-net-tor` depends on this service, so onion deployments serve all whitelisted third-party assets from the onion itself."
msgstr "**Tor- siap:** `svc-net-tor` tergantung pada layanan ini, sehingga pengiriman bawang melayani semua Whitelisted aset pihak ketiga dari bawang itu sendiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Traefik migration / edge HA.** v1 keeps openresty as the swarm edge (pinned to manager) to preserve the `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body-rewriting pipeline unchanged. Migrating to Traefik for true multi-replica edge HA is a follow-up requirement and is gated on porting the body_filter.lua injection logic (CSP-meta stripping + head/body snippet injection for Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout) to a Traefik Yaegi plugin OR introducing a Traefik → openresty chain. Without one of those, switching the edge to Traefik would silently drop the frontend-injection pipeline."
msgstr "**Traefik migration / edge HA.** v1 membuat openresty sebagai ujung kawanan (disematkan ke manajer) untuk melestarikan `sys-front-inj-*` Tubuh Lua menulis ulang pipa tidak berubah. Migrasi ke Traefik untuk benar multi- replika edge HA adalah persyaratan-up dan gated pada porting body_filter.lua injeksi logic (CSP-meta stripping + head / body snippet injeksi untuk Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout) ke plugin Traefik Yaegi atau memperkenalkan rantai Traefik Openresti. Tanpa salah satu dari mereka, beralih tepi ke Traefik diam-diam akan menjatuhkan depan-pipa injeksi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Transform values:** Use filters to transform, extract, reformat, or compute values from existing variables or facts."
msgstr "**Nilai transformasi:** Gunakan penyaring untuk mengubah, ekstrak, format ulang, atau nilai perhitungan dari variabel atau fakta yang ada."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Translated data:** ``lang`` and ``Accept-Language`` translate role descriptions and category texts; ``/v1/catalogs/core/<code>`` returns a whole catalog as JSON and ``/v1/languages`` reports how complete each language is."
msgstr "**Data diterjemahkan:** ``lang`` dan ``Accept-Language`` terjemahkan deskripsi peran dan teks kategori; ``/v1/catalogs/core/<code>`` mengembalikan seluruh katalog sebagai JSON dan ``/v1/languages`` melaporkan bagaimana lengkap setiap bahasa."

