# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr "**`deny`** (mendahului 1): struktur bentuk destruktif diblokir langsung, bahkan ketika sandboxed. Penutup loop shell (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross- repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, istimewa `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), dan bermutasi `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge tapak)."

