msgstr "Seorang pembungkus orkestra tingkat tinggi, *sys-stk-front-proxy* ikatan bersama beberapa peran tingkat rendah:"

msgid "A host deployed with its own vault password takes `--host-vault-password-file <host>=<file>`, so its private key opens there."
