# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A token naming a role the discovery query does not return at all is reported too, but as a warning, whether or not it pins axes: the diff-derived whitelist legitimately names roles the envelope filters out, and it pins the variants a change reaches. Role names themselves are checked against `roles/` before the run starts (scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh), so a typo is caught there rather than swallowed here."
msgstr "Sebuah tanda penamaan peran pencarian penemuan tidak kembali sama sekali dilaporkan juga, tetapi sebagai peringatan, apakah atau tidak pin kapak: diffdered whitelist nama resmi nama amplop filter keluar, dan pin varians perubahan mencapai. Nama peran sendiri dicentang `roles/` sebelum jalankan dimulai (scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh), sehingga tipo tertangkap di sana daripada ditelan di sini."

