msgstr ""

msgid "An account whose `user.theme` is still empty (every account the role or a visitor creates) loses the frio scheme on its first save of `/settings/display`: `src/Module/Settings/Display.php:194` calls `theme_post()` only when the posted theme equals the stored one, so the first post only stores `theme = frio` (measured 2026-10-14: a post with `frio_scheme=dark` while the stored theme differed left the scheme at `---`; the second post stored it); options: report upstream to compare against `$user['theme'] ?: system.theme`, or let the role store `theme = frio` for the accounts it provisions."
msgstr ""

