msgid "An adapter could reach these, and none has been curated yet. The five that used to sit under \"current MCP metadata requiring revalidation\" are here because that revalidation found no shipped surface to revalidate."
msgstr "Adaptor bisa mencapai ini, dan belum ada kurated belum. Lima yang digunakan untuk duduk di bawah \"metadata MCP saat ini membutuhkan revalidasi\" di sini karena revalidasi yang ditemukan tidak ada permukaan dikirim ke revalidate."

msgid "An addon MAY pin a release through `config.archive`. Before `occ app:install`, [02_install.yml](./02_install.yml) stages the archive on the node and pipes it into [files/shell/utils/replace_pinned_app.sh](../../../files/shell/utils/replace_pinned_app.sh) inside the container:"
