msgid "Any `gh extension` subcommand. `install` and `upgrade` pull remote code that then runs in-process under the operator's GitHub credentials on every subsequent `gh` invocation; `remove`/`list`/`search`/`exec` are blocked alongside to keep the namespace simple. Extensions belong to a deliberate operator decision, not an agent."
msgstr "Apapun `gh extension` Sub perintah. `install` dan `upgrade` tarik kode remote yang kemudian berjalan in- proses di bawah operator GitHub kredensial pada setiap selanjutnya `gh` Doa. `remove`/`list`/`search`/`exec` diblokir bersama untuk menjaga ruang nama sederhana. Ekstensi milik keputusan operator yang disengaja, bukan agen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh gpg-key` subcommand. `add` installs a persistent commit-signing identity an attacker could use to impersonate the operator on signed commits; `delete` can lock the operator out of signed-commit policies; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr "Apapun `gh gpg-key` Sub perintah. `add` menginstal sebuah commit- penandatanganan identitas seorang penyerang dapat digunakan untuk meniru operator pada alokasi signed; `delete` dapat mengunci operator dari kebijakan signed- commit; `list` kebocoran inventaris kunci-sidik jari. Hanya manajemen kunci band."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh secret` subcommand. `set`/`remove` mutate CI secrets under the operator's identity; `list` leaks secret names, the exact same risk class as the `gh api * /actions/secrets*` deny (\"Even GETs leak secret names\"). Out-of-band secret management only."
msgstr "Apapun `gh secret` Sub perintah. `set`/`remove` Mutasi rahasia CI di bawah identitas operator; `list` kebocoran nama rahasia, sama persis kelas risiko seperti `gh api * /actions/secrets*` menyangkal (\"Bahkan GETS membocorkan nama rahasia\"). Hanya management rahasia band."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh ssh-key` subcommand. `add` is a persistent auth backdoor giving shell-equivalent push access until revoked; `delete` can lock the operator out; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr "Apapun `gh ssh-key` Sub perintah. `add` adalah backdoor gigih memberikan shell- akses push ekuivalen sampai dicabut; `delete` dapat mengunci operator keluar; `list` kebocoran inventaris kunci-sidik jari. Hanya manajemen kunci band."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh variable` subcommand. Mirror of the `gh secret *` rule for Actions variables. Variables are unencrypted secrets-lite; even `list` exposes their values directly, so the entire namespace is blocked and managed out-of-band."
msgstr "Apapun `gh variable` Sub perintah. Cermin `gh secret *` aturan untuk variabel Aksi. Variabel tidak terenkripsi secrets-lite; bahkan `list` mengekspos nilai-nilai mereka secara langsung, sehingga seluruh namespace diblokir dan berhasil keluar - of- band."

