# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both halves are required: ``tor.enabled`` is the dependency edge, not the port forward, so a client picking the Tor transport from that flag alone dials a port with no HiddenServicePort and no host publish."
msgstr "Kedua bagian diperlukan: ``tor.enabled`` adalah ujung ketergantungan, bukan port ke depan, sehingga klien memilih transportasi Tor dari bendera itu saja mengarahkan port tanpa HiddenServicePort dan tidak ada host mempublikasikan."

msgid "Both halves may come through other names. A bare local port number, as ``LDAP.SERVER.PORT``, is left out, because containers pair it with a service name; so are the vhost inputs (``http_port`` and its siblings), which openresty hands to ``proxy_pass`` and swarm ignores, and every value that hands one to the vhost."
