msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumen a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Peran terus `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (Jadi kontrak ini tetap memuaskan.) tapi `roles_with_service('matomo')` tetes dari `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` dan tracker matoo e2e kontrak. Dicadangkan untuk berkas statistik (autoindeks) dan 301-redirect vhost yang tidak membawa user- menghadap halaman HTML layak `_paq` Pelacak. Tanda yang menyertai `track:` Data bendera lookup kehormatan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumen a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Peran terus `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (Jadi kontrak ini tetap memuaskan.) tapi `roles_with_service('prometheus')` tetes dari `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Dicadangkan untuk 301-redirect -only vhost yang tidak pernah melayani permintaan melalui lua- resty- proglas, sehingga mereka memancarkan tidak `app=\"<role>\"` label dan tidak memiliki target mengikis. Tanda yang menyertai `scrape:` Data bendera lookup kehormatan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Dokumen `unsafe-*: true` tanda in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. Harus dipasangkan dengan `Reason:` pada baris yang sama menyebutkan apa istirahat tanpa relaksasi. `unsafe-inline` akui kembali eksekusi inline sebuah kebutuhan XSS dan `unsafe-eval` akui kembali string- to-code, sehingga flag harus diverifikasi terhadap aplikasi yang berjalan, tidak disalin dari peran lain."

