# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every apt suite exists twice, once per upstream mirror. Nexus has no group repository type for `apt` (only maven, raw, docker, yum, npm, pypi, rubygems, go and friends), so the failover lives in the frontend: a request that the primary repo answers with `502`/`503`/`504` is re-run against the `-mirror` repo, which proxies a different host. `404` deliberately does not retry, because a missing file is missing on both mirrors and apt probes for missing files often. The frontend waits at most 8 s for a primary before it re-runs the request against the mirror; the `-mirror` locations keep the global 300 s."
msgstr "Setiap apt suite ada dua kali, sekali per hulu cermin. Nexus has no grup repositori type for `apt` (Hanya maven, mentah, docker, yum, npm, pypi, rubygems, pergi dan teman-teman), sehingga pengasih tinggal di depan: permintaan bahwa repo utama jawaban dengan `502`/`503`/`504` adalah re- run terhadap `-mirror` repo, yang proxies tuan rumah yang berbeda. `404` sengaja tidak mencoba lagi, karena file yang hilang hilang pada kedua cermin dan apt probe untuk file yang hilang sering. front menunggu paling 8 s untuk primer sebelum re- berjalan permintaan terhadap cermin; `-mirror` lokasi menjaga global 300 s."

