msgstr ""

msgid "Every server host runs the `log collector <../sys-svc-log-collector/README.md>`__, which pushes its journal to ``https://loki.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/loki/api/v1/push``. The vhost serves only that path, only for ``POST``, and only with the bearer token ``push_token`` from ``meta/secrets.yml``; it keeps the token’s SHA-256, answers ``401`` without a matching token and ``403`` for any tenant but ``services.loki.tenant``. Every other path answers ``404``. ``meta/networks.yml`` restricts the role to clearnet and the role declares no ``tor`` service, so the ingest endpoint never answers on an onion address."
