# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that exercise custom Ansible action plugins end-to-end through real playbook runs (e.g. retry behavior of `uri` / `get_url` wrappers)."
msgstr "Tes integrasi yang latihan plugin aksi Ansible gubahan akhir-ke-end melalui running playbook nyata (mis. Coba kembali perilaku dari `uri` / `get_url` pembungkus)."

