# code-scanning peringatan dan tambahkan penjaga rekursi. Mematahkan siklus
# impor yang tak aman *cli/administration/deploy/development* via a leaf
# *env.py*; mengeras *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (prototipe cookie - penjaga
# polusi, log sanitisasi, HTML- lolos pengecualian, ReDoS- dibatasi menangani
# regex) dan *web-app-baserow* SSO open-redirect handling; dibutuhkan TLS 1f
# 1.2 dalam probe diagnosis jaringan; divalidasi *conctionlint* anggota tar
# terhadap jalur traversal; menulis ulang *desimal*/*apt- membersihkan*
# regexes untuk menghindari bencana backtracking; berlabuh enam URL Playwright
# regexes dan disematkan *crs-k / stale- branch* ke SHA. Pengawal:
# *penting-linter* kontrak, sebuah benang membutuhkan alasan bandit *noqa*,
# dan ruff *BLE001* sebagai ratchet.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Security: resolved all 80 open CodeQL/code-scanning alerts and added recurrence guards. Broke an unsafe import cycle in *cli/administration/deploy/development* via a leaf *env.py*; hardened *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (cookie prototype-pollution guard, log sanitisation, HTML-escaped exceptions, ReDoS-bounded handle regex) and *web-app-baserow* SSO open-redirect handling; required TLS ≥ 1.2 in network diagnose probes; validated *actionlint* tar members against path traversal; rewrote *decidim*/*apt-purge* regexes to avoid catastrophic backtracking; anchored six Playwright URL regexes and pinned *crs-k/stale-branches* to a SHA. Guards: an *import-linter* contract, a lint requiring justified bandit *noqa*, and ruff *BLE001* as a ratchet."
msgstr "Keamanan: diselesaikan semua 80 buka CodeQL / code-scanning peringatan dan tambahkan penjaga rekursi. Mematahkan siklus impor yang tak aman *cli/administration/deploy/development* via a leaf *env.py*; mengeras *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (prototipe cookie - penjaga polusi, log sanitisasi, HTML- lolos pengecualian, ReDoS- dibatasi menangani regex) dan *web-app-baserow* SSO open-redirect handling; dibutuhkan TLS 1f 1.2 dalam probe diagnosis jaringan; divalidasi *conctionlint* anggota tar terhadap jalur traversal; menulis ulang *desimal*/*apt- membersihkan* regexes untuk menghindari bencana backtracking; berlabuh enam URL Playwright regexes dan disematkan *crs-k / stale- branch* ke SHA. Pengawal: *penting-linter* kontrak, sebuah benang membutuhkan alasan bandit *noqa*, dan ruff *BLE001* sebagai ratchet."

msgid "Security: the identity headers are trusted unconditionally, so openresty is the only trust boundary: every front-proxy location clears or overwrites `X-Forwarded-*`. Anything that reaches the app port without passing openresty can open the owner session. That port is published on `DOCKER_BIND_HOST`, which is `0.0.0.0` under `DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER`, and in swarm the routing mesh publishes it on every node. The `X-Auth-Request-*` / `Remote-User` variants are deliberately ignored so an already-authenticated client cannot inject a different identity. Logout must go through `web-svc-logout` / the oauth2-proxy sign-out, not Postmarks' own logout link, because the proxy header re-establishes the session on the next request."
msgstr ""

msgid "Security: the identity headers are trusted unconditionally, so openresty is the only trust boundary: every front-proxy location clears or overwrites ``X-Forwarded-*``. Anything that reaches the app port without passing openresty can open the owner session. That port is published on ``DOCKER_BIND_HOST``, which is ``0.0.0.0`` under ``DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER``, and in swarm the routing mesh publishes it on every node. The ``X-Auth-Request-*`` / ``Remote-User`` variants are deliberately ignored so an already-authenticated client cannot inject a different identity. Logout must go through ``web-svc-logout`` / the oauth2-proxy sign-out, not Postmarks’ own logout link, because the proxy header re-establishes the session on the next request."
msgstr ""

