msgid "Shared decision steps of the iterate routines: the relevant-delta check before a rerun, and the red chain a red or still-running run passes before the loop inspects it (the watchdog, the reached check and the signature stop rule). Every decision writes its branch label under its step id and appends one record to the ledger (``agents.routines.contract.decide``). A decision without its evidence takes its first branch, so a stub run reaches a terminal. An agent following a routine by hand runs a decision with ``python -m agents.routines decide <routine> <step> --state <state.json>``, which every label names; the state keys it reads are ``STATE_KEYS``."
msgstr ""

