msgid "Shared deterministic tool nodes for the routines: pure functions that parse a log, a diff or a text and return a verdict, with no model call and no live I/O. A routine graph wraps one of these into a node that reads the tool's inputs from the run state and writes its result back; the pure function is what a unit test exercises on a recorded fixture."
