# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr "Taiga mengarahkan kembali `/` kepada publik `/discover` Showcase, yang menghasilkan link Login telanjang tetapi tidak titik masukan OIDC; hanya `/login` mengikat direktif SSO (lihat catatan di [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js))The personas bersama selalu masuk di akar situs, sehingga mereka tidak pernah dapat mencapai TaigaTombol SSO. Cangkang AngularJS Taiga sengaja mengekspos logout hanya melalui `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` direktif, yang generik pembantu logout in- app tidak dapat mengaktifkan. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Oleh karena itu menyatakan `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` dan `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; perjalanan ekuivalen didorong oleh role- lokal `test-login-oidc.js` dan `test-login-native.js` spesifikasi, yang masuk di `/login` dan log keluar melalui Taigakontrol sendiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects ``/`` to the public ``/discover`` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only ``/login`` binds the SSO directive (see the note in ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` and log out through Taiga’s own control."
msgstr "Taiga mengarahkan kembali ``/`` kepada publik ``/discover`` Showcase, yang menghasilkan link Login telanjang tetapi tidak titik masukan OIDC; hanya ``/login`` mengikat direktif SSO (lihat catatan di ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` dan log keluar melalui Taigakontrol sendiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
