msgid "The `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "The `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ adalah agen yang menjalankan proyek kerja GitHub Actions pada infrastruktur Anda sendiri, bukan mesin GitHub yang diselenggarakan."

