# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `all` mode honors a per-interpreter stamp at `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (the suffix is the first 8 chars of `sha256(sys.executable)`, so host and container track independently even though `build/` is bind-mounted). Stamp dependencies are [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) and [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Group-targeted invocations always run and never touch the stamp."
msgstr "The `all` mode menghormati sebuah prangko per- interpreter di `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (akhiran adalah yang pertama 8 chars `sha256(sys.executable)`, sehingga jalur host dan kontainer independen meskipun `build/` adalah bind- mount). Ketergantungan stamp adalah [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) dan [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Kelompok-ditargetkan doa selalu berjalan dan tidak pernah menyentuh perangko."

