msgstr "The `biber` dan `administrator` Playwright personas are gated on `services.sso.enabled`. Ketika SSO mati, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) render `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` dan `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Dua alasan:"

