msgid "The classic failure shape (`DNS [OK]`, `TCP [OK]`, `TLS [FAIL] TimeoutError after 8s`) is an __MTU mismatch__, not a TLS-layer bug. Small packets (TCP-SYN, DNS replies) survive; the larger TLS-ServerHello with the certificate chain is dropped silently because the path MTU is below the bridge MTU and ICMP-needs-frag is filtered upstream. When `auth.docker.io` is OK but `ghcr.io` / `registry-1.docker.io` time out, the chain-length difference between hosts (Cloudflare-fronted ≈ small chain, GitHub/AWS ≈ large chain) confirms MTU as the cause rather than a blanket TLS block."
msgstr "Bentuk kegagalan klasik (`DNS [OK]`, `TCP [OK]`, `TLS [FAIL] TimeoutError after 8s`) _ _ MTU mismatch__, bukan sebuah TLS-layer bug. Paket kecil (TCP- SYN, DNS membalas) bertahan; yang lebih besar TLS- ServerHello dengan rantai sertifikat dijatuhkan diam-diam karena jalur MTU berada di bawah jembatan MTU dan ICMP- perlu-frag disaring hulu. Kapan `auth.docker.io` adalah OK tapi `ghcr.io` / `registry-1.docker.io` waktu habis, perbedaan chain- panjang antara host (Cloudflane-front rantai kecil, GitHub / AWS rantai besar) Mengkonfirmasi MTU sebagai penyebab daripada blok TLS selimut."

