msgid "The pgAdmin container runs at its `mem_limit: 256m`: `memory.current` 252 to 265 MiB with `memory.events max` at 1098 to 1774 within minutes of a start, no OOM kill. The administrator convergence script (`/venv/bin/python3` with `create_app`) peaks at 197 MiB RSS and takes about 27 s at `cpus: \"0.2\"`. Options: raise `mem_limit` to 512m and `cpus` to 0.5 in `meta/services.yml`, or keep the limits and accept the reclaim pressure."
