msgid "The pinned Nexus Community Edition has no public API for cleanup policies or for creating tasks. The [bootstrap](../../../roles/svc-cache-package/files/shell/bootstrap.sh) therefore writes the policy through the internal `/service/rest/internal/cleanup-policies` endpoint with the all-formats value `*`, checks for the `repository.cleanup` task Nexus schedules at every startup, and creates the `blobstore.compact` task through the Ext.Direct call `coreui_Task.create` the web UI uses. A deleted asset frees disk only after the `assetBlob.cleanup` task has soft-deleted its blob, which happens at the earliest an hour after the blob was written, and a compaction has removed it; `make cache-evict` exits non-zero when the blob store stays above its cap or lacks one of these tasks."
