# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the upstream ``ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome`` image behind the central reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Everything the application keeps lives in one volume at ``/data``: the SQLite database, uploaded media, and installed apps. The administrator account is provisioned from the role’s generated credential, and the role finishes the upstream first-boot wizard over the API so the front page renders a login form instead of a setup screen."
msgstr "Peran berjalan hulu ``ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome`` gambar di balik proksi terbalik pusat pada domain kanonikal sendiri. Segala sesuatu yang aplikasi terus hidup dalam satu volume di ``/data``: Database SQLite, media terunggah, dan aplikasi terinstal. Akun administrator diberikan dari kredensial yang dihasilkan peran, dan peran menyelesaikan upstream pertama-boot wizard atas API sehingga halaman depan membuat bentuk login daripada layar setup."

