msgid "The shell prefix, or an empty string when email is disabled."
msgstr "Prefiks shell, atau string kosong ketika email tidak aktif."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The shell-side installer scripts loop over distros with their own variable, so they render ``{slug}`` themselves rather than per distro."
msgstr "The shell- side installer script loop atas distros dengan variabel mereka sendiri, sehingga mereka render ``{slug}`` diri mereka sendiri daripada setiap gangguan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shipped weights are `locality: 1.0`, `cost: 0.4`, `speed: 0.25`, `caching: 0.15`, `throughput: 0.1`, and the constraint behind them is that locality **exceeds** the sum of the others, so no combination of the rest outscores staying in the cluster. That is a preference, not the protection: decision 7's restriction removes remote candidates before this runs, which is why a weighting that sends everything to the cheapest provider still cannot send a credential there."
msgstr "Yang dikirim bobot `locality: 1.0`, `cost: 0.4`, `speed: 0.25`, `caching: 0.15`, `throughput: 0.1`, dan kendala di belakang mereka adalah bahwa localitas **melebihi** jumlah yang lain, sehingga tidak ada kombinasi dari outscore sisanya tinggal di cluster. Itu adalah preferensi, bukan perlindungan: keputusan 7Pembatasan menghapus kandidat jarak jauh sebelum dijalankan, itulah sebabnya pengbobot yang mengirim segalanya ke penyedia termurah masih belum dapat mengirim kredensial ke sana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shipped weights keep locality worth at least the other factors combined"
msgstr "Bobot dikirim tetap lokal layak setidaknya faktor lain dikombinasikan"

msgid "The short human form of a plan: one line per tier and per row, the cuts last."
msgstr ""

