# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is an accepted trade-off, not an oversight. Moodle offers no allowlist, so a single internal host cannot be permitted without unblocking the range it sits in. The cost is that any account holding a URL-fetching capability, such as ``block/rss_client:myaddinstance`` or a ``repository/url`` instance, can make the server issue requests to sibling containers. Grant those capabilities only to roles you trust with that reach, or keep the upstream blocklist and accept that SSO login and the AI surface do not work."
msgstr "Ini adalah perdagangan yang diterima, bukan pengawasan. Moodle menawarkan tidak ada allowlist, sehingga host internal tunggal tidak dapat diijinkan tanpa unblocking jangkauan duduk di. Biaya adalah bahwa setiap account memegang kemampuan URL- mengambil, seperti ``block/rss_client:myaddinstance`` atau ``repository/url`` instance, can make the server issues request to sibling contains. Hibah kemampuan-kemampuan hanya untuk peran yang Anda percaya dengan jangkauan itu, atau menjaga daftar blok hulu dan menerima bahwa SSO login dan permukaan AI tidak bekerja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is an accepted trade-off, not an oversight. Moodle offers no allowlist, so a single internal host cannot be permitted without unblocking the range it sits in. The cost is that any account holding a URL-fetching capability, such as `block/rss_client:myaddinstance` or a `repository/url` instance, can make the server issue requests to sibling containers. Grant those capabilities only to roles you trust with that reach, or keep the upstream blocklist and accept that SSO login and the AI surface do not work."
