# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; segerombolan ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) untuk antarmuka aplikasi, atau ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` bagi sespan bernama (sso- proxy)A ``host_gateway`` aplikasi menjalankan node- lokal di bawah kawanan dan mempublikasikan port lokal ke host, sehingga proksi overlay- terpasang mencapai itu di ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` melalui gateway host (penelepon set ini dari nyata DEPLOYMENT_MODE, karena aplikasi tersebut memaksa sebuah perombakan gaya render)Kehilangan banyak pelabuhan internal dengan susah payah."

