# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Berjalan (mungkin bersarang) kredensial skema dan memancarkan satu blok lemari besi per daun skalar ke ``dest_node``. Naskah sarang (mis. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) berulang ke nested CommentedMaps sehingga setiap daun menjadi sendiri valet - dienkripsi entri bukannya sedang runtuh melalui ``str(dict)`` menjadi gumpalan Python- repr (regresi yang pecah run 26428080957 tugas 77797371397 dan 77797371442 untuk web-app-espocrm dan web-app-listmonk)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
