# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When the log carries the matrix-deploy round/pass markers, the result is segmented (one block of records per variant round + pass). Otherwise a single combined block is returned. Runtime rows are read from the ``ROLES RECAP`` sections only (never ``TASKS RECAP``, whose role-less task rows would double-count); a log without any recap header falls back to reading every profile-shaped line. The recap ``total`` line survives as the ``total`` row so consumers can cross-check the parsed sum. Per-host task results (``ok:``, ``changed:``, ``skipping:``, ``fatal:``, ``failed:`` under a ``TASK [role : ...]`` header) accumulate into each record's ``hosts`` field; delegation targets (``[host -> other]``) count for the source host. Raises FileNotFoundError when the log is absent (the caller turns that into a hard failure)."
msgstr "Ketika log membawa matriks-menyebarkan penanda round / pass, hasilnya tersegmentasi (satu blok dari catatan per variant round + pass). Jika tidak satu blok gabungan dikembalikan. Baris runtime dibaca dari ``ROLES RECAP`` hanya bagian (tidak pernah ``TASKS RECAP``, yang baris tugas kurang baris akan double-count); sebuah log tanpa header recap apapun jatuh kembali ke membaca setiap baris profile- berbentuk. Rekap ``total`` garis bertahan sebagai ``total`` baris sehingga konsumen dapat cross- memeriksa jumlah parsed. Per- host hasil tugas (``ok:``, ``changed:``, ``skipping:``, ``fatal:``, ``failed:`` di bawah ``TASK [role : ...]`` tajuk) akumulasi ke setiap catatan ``hosts`` field; target delegasi (``[host -> other]``) hitungan untuk host sumber. Raises FileNotFoundError ketika log tidak ada (Penelepon mengubahnya menjadi kegagalan yang sulit)."

