msgid "With ``ldap`` on and ``sso`` off, ```files/playwright/test-ldap-login.js`` <./files/playwright/test-ldap-login.js>`__ signs the platform administrator in through EspoCRM’s own form, which binds against the directory, and ```files/playwright/test-rbac.js`` <./files/playwright/test-rbac.js>`__ asserts that ``ldapUserLoginFilter`` refuses ``biber``. ``test-ldap-login.js`` then adds ``biber`` to the ``user`` role group in the directory through ``withLdapGroupMember`` from the shared personas library, signs it in through the same form, asserts a regular EspoCRM user with the ``Users`` team whose call of the administration route ends on EspoCRM’s 403 page, signs it out and removes the membership again."
