# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the label set, the `detect-affected-roles` job in [entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml) calls [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh), which runs the [cli.meta.ci.subset_roles](../../../../cli/meta/ci/subset_roles.py) module. The module reads the first fenced block whose YAML carries a `roles:` key (the heading text is not matched) and emits that list as the `whitelist` output, which flows into the deploy tests as precedence rung 2 above. Without the label, the diff-driven precedence applies."
msgstr "Dengan label ditetapkan, yang `detect-affected-roles` tugas di [entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml) panggilan [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh), yang berjalan [cli.meta.ci.subset_roles](../../../../cli/meta/ci/subset_roles.py) modul. Modul membaca blok pagar pertama yang AML membawa `roles:` kunci (teks judul tidak cocok) dan memancarkan daftar sebagai `whitelist` keluaran, yang mengalir ke dalam tes perakitan sebagai prioritas rung 2 di atas. Tanpa label, diff- didorong mendahului berlaku."

msgid "With the mail provider in the deployment, the primary address of every user is `<username>@<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>`, set automatically and not changeable by the user. Every user also holds a secondary address; registration requires it by default. Confirmations go to the secondary address, and changing it needs a confirmation link sent to the new address."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the service enabled, ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` reads the token stored for ``administrator`` under this role’s id, probes it against the running instance with a JSON-RPC ``initialize`` call, mints a replacement through ``gitlab-rails runner`` when the stored token is missing or rejected, writes the fresh token back through ``sys-token-store``, and fails the deploy when the re-probe is still rejected. The minted token is a personal access token carrying the ``mcp`` scope with a 364-day expiry. That scope is filtered out of the interactive token picker, so tokens for this endpoint are created programmatically."
msgstr "Dengan layanan diaktifkan, ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` membaca token yang disimpan untuk ``administrator`` di bawah id peran ini, probe itu terhadap contoh berjalan dengan JSON- RPC ``initialize`` call, mints pengganti melalui ``gitlab-rails runner`` ketika token tersimpan hilang atau ditolak, menulis token segar kembali melalui ``sys-token-store``, dan gagal menyebarkan ketika re- probe masih ditolak. Token berharga adalah sebuah tanda akses pribadi membawa ``mcp`` scope dengan 364-hari kadaluarsa. Scope itu disaring dari pemetik token interaktif, jadi token untuk titik akhir ini diciptakan secara programmatik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the service enabled, `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` reads the token stored for `administrator` under this role's id, probes it against the running instance with a JSON-RPC `initialize` call, mints a replacement through `gitlab-rails runner` when the stored token is missing or rejected, writes the fresh token back through `sys-token-store`, and fails the deploy when the re-probe is still rejected. The minted token is a personal access token carrying the `mcp` scope with a 364-day expiry. That scope is filtered out of the interactive token picker, so tokens for this endpoint are created programmatically."
msgstr "Dengan layanan diaktifkan, `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` membaca token yang disimpan untuk `administrator` di bawah id peran ini, probe itu terhadap contoh berjalan dengan JSON- RPC `initialize` call, mints pengganti melalui `gitlab-rails runner` ketika token tersimpan hilang atau ditolak, menulis token segar kembali melalui `sys-token-store`, dan gagal menyebarkan ketika re- probe masih ditolak. Token berharga adalah sebuah tanda akses pribadi membawa `mcp` scope dengan 364-hari kadaluarsa. Scope itu disaring dari pemetik token interaktif, jadi token untuk titik akhir ini diciptakan secara programmatik."

