# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Caveman](https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman) is a token-compression plugin installed via `make install-skills`. It reduces output token consumption through progressively terser communication styles. `make install-skills` copies the skills from the repository pinned as `INFINITO_SKILLS_REPOSITORY` in the generated `.env` (override via `custom.env`, see `docs/contributing/customize.md`); the [skills](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/skills) repository pins every skill in its `skills-lock.json` and also supports global installs via its own `make install`. This works universally across all supported agents: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf, Cline, and more."
msgstr "[Caveman](https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman) adalah sebuah plugin token-compression terpasang via `make install-skills`. Ini mengurangi konsumsi token keluaran melalui progresif terser komunikasi gaya. `make install-skills` menyalin keterampilan dari repositori disematkan sebagai `INFINITO_SKILLS_REPOSITORY` dalam dihasilkan `.env` (override via `custom.env`, lihat `docs/contributing/customize.md`); [keterampilan](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/skills) peniti repositori setiap keterampilan di dalamnya `skills-lock.json` dan juga mendukung instalasi global melalui sendiri `make install`. Ini bekerja secara universal di semua agen yang didukung: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf, Cline, dan banyak lagi."

