msgid "[Coturn](https://github.com/coturn/coturn) is a free and open-source **TURN (Traversal Using Relays around NAT)** and **STUN (Session Traversal Utilities for NAT)** server.   It enables real-time communication (RTC) applications such as **WebRTC** to work reliably across NATs and firewalls."
msgstr "[Cotum](https://github.com/coturn/coturn) adalah open-source bebas dan terbuka **TURN (Traversal Menggunakan Relay di sekitar NAT)** dan **STUN (Utilitas Traversal Sesi bagi NAT)** server. Ini memungkinkan komunikasi real-time (RTC) aplikasi seperti **WebRTC** untuk bekerja diandalkan di seluruh agen pelatihan dan firewall."

