# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[call-orchestrator.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/call-orchestrator.yml) compares `github.ref` for the same reason: a called workflow inherits the caller's ref, which is `refs/pull/<n>/merge` for a `pull_request` caller but `refs/heads/main` for a `pull_request_target` one. The `ci-orchestrator` job of `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` is fenced to `github.event_name == 'pull_request'`, so the ref the orchestrator sees from that caller is always the merge ref; widening that fence would silently put fork runs into main's group."
msgstr "[call-orchestrator.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/call-orchestrator.yml) perbandingan `github.ref` untuk alasan yang sama: yang disebut alur kerja mewarisi ref pemanggil, yang `refs/pull/<n>/merge` untuk `pull_request` pemanggil tetapi `refs/heads/main` untuk `pull_request_target` Satu. The `ci-orchestrator` tugas `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` berpagar untuk `github.event_name == 'pull_request'`, sehingga ref yang mengatur melihat dari penelepon yang selalu ref gabungan; memperluas pagar yang diam-diam akan menempatkan garpu berjalan ke kelompok utama."

