msgid "[pr.sh](../../../../../scripts/github/update/open/pr.sh) reads `APP_SLUG` from the environment and resolves the App's bot user via `gh api /users/<slug>[bot]`. The resolved login and numeric user ID are written into `git config user.name` and `git config user.email` in the `<id>+<slug>[bot]@users.noreply.github.com` form that GitHub accepts for verified commits. When `APP_SLUG` is unset, the script falls back to the `github-actions[bot]` identity. That branch is reached only when the script is invoked outside the workflow, for example a local smoke test where the caller has set `GH_TOKEN` to something other than an App token."
msgstr "[pr.sh](../../../../../scripts/github/update/open/pr.sh) baca `APP_SLUG` dari lingkungan dan menyelesaikan pengguna bot App melalui `gh api /users/<slug>[bot]`. ID pengguna login dan numerik terpecahkan ditulis ke dalam `git config user.name` dan `git config user.email` di `<id>+<slug>[bot]@users.noreply.github.com` formulir yang GitHub terima untuk melakukan verifikasi. Kapan `APP_SLUG` adalah unset, script jatuh kembali ke `github-actions[bot]` Identitas. Cabang tersebut hanya dicapai ketika skrip dipanggil di luar alur kerja, misalnya tes asap lokal di mana penelepon telah diset `GH_TOKEN` untuk sesuatu yang lain selain tanda App."

