# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. Penpot image versions, exporter resource limits, `PENPOT_FLAGS` set, lifecycle starting tier, secrets source) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched round, BEFORE any file is changed. Ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[x] **Mengklarifikasi pertanyaan hanya pada awalnya.** Setiap pertanyaan terbuka, ambiguitas, atau hilang keputusan (Versi gambar Penpot, batas sumber daya ekspor, `PENPOT_FLAGS` set, lifecycle mulai tier, sumber rahasia) Harus dibesarkan sekali di awal menjalankan, dalam putaran batched tunggal, sebelum file berubah. Ambiguitas ditemukan pertengahan - run HARUS diselesaikan oleh agen menggunakan penilaian terbaik, dicatat dalam peran `README.md` atau komentar kode, dan revited hanya di PR review."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. which CI runner technology, what the `distribution` parameter switches, how `roles` is interpreted, what the `output stream file` default is, lifecycle starting tier, secrets/registration-token source) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched question round, BEFORE any file is changed. Once those questions are answered, the agent MUST NOT pause for further clarification — additional ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[x] **Mengklarifikasi pertanyaan hanya pada awalnya.** Setiap pertanyaan terbuka, ambiguitas, atau hilang keputusan (mis. teknologi CI runner, apa yang `distribution` parameter switches, how `roles` adalah ditafsirkan, apa yang `output stream file` baku adalah, lifecycle mulai tingkat, rahasia / registration- sumber token) Harus dibangkitkan sekali di awal menjalankan, dalam putaran pertanyaan batched tunggal, sebelum file berubah. Setelah pertanyaan-pertanyaan dijawab, agen HARUS TIDAK jeda untuk klarifikasi lebih lanjut - ambiguitas tambahan ditemukan pertengahan - jalankan HARUS diselesaikan oleh agen menggunakan penilaian terbaik, dicatat dalam peran `README.md` atau komentar kode, dan revited hanya di PR review."

