msgid "[x] Every MCP server role declares an application-scoped `mcp` RBAC role, and each client enforces the corresponding server grant. Open WebUI MAY resolve or create its unpredictable local group identifier by group name and apply `access_grants` through the API, but unscoped `roles: [mcp]`, wrong-application membership, last-group removal, and post-restart reconciliation MUST be fixed and tested as defined by requirement 035. All four hold: `granted_roles` drops an `APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES` name declared unscoped (`test_rbac_scoped.py::test_an_unscoped_scoped_role_grants_nothing_anywhere`); a scoped grant reaches only its own application, and another provider's group id does not enable a connection (`test_mcp_tool_server_connections.py`); `reconcile_members` sets a group to exactly the entitled set rather than relying on the claim sync (`test_provision_mcp_grants.py::test_a_group_that_lost_its_last_member_is_emptied`); and the grant travels in `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`, so a restart restores it. The declaration itself is held by [test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py)."
msgstr "[x] Setiap peran server MCP mendeklarasikan suatu application- scoped `mcp` RBAC peran, dan setiap klien memaksakan hibah server yang sesuai. Buka penyelesaian WebUI MEY atau buat identifikasi grup lokal tak terduga berdasarkan nama grup dan terapkan `access_grants` melalui API, tetapi unscoped `roles: [mcp]`, keanggotaan aplikasi, penghapusan grup terakhir, dan posting-restart rekonsiliasi HARUS tetap dan diuji sebagai didefinisikan oleh persyaratan 035. Semua empat terus: `granted_roles` tetes `APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES` nama dideklarasikan unscoped (`test_rbac_scoped.py::test_an_unscoped_scoped_role_grants_nothing_anywhere`); hibah scoped hanya mencapai aplikasi sendiri, dan id grup penyedia lain tidak mengaktifkan koneksi (`test_mcp_tool_server_connections.py`); `reconcile_members` set sebuah grup ke set berhak bukan mengandalkan pada claim sync (`test_provision_mcp_grants.py::test_a_group_that_lost_its_last_member_is_emptied`); dan perjalanan hibah dalam `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`, jadi restart restore itu. Pernyataan itu sendiri dipegang oleh [test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py)."

