msgid "[x] The three baseline personas are covered per the [Playwright contract](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): `guest` (never reaches an authenticated surface), `biber`, `administrator`, each in its own `test-*.js` module aggregated by `playwright.spec.js`, with SSO/LDAP steps guarded by `skipUnlessServiceEnabled`. `guest` runs live; `biber` and `administrator` are blocked with `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` under the contract's documented escape, each carrying a `# nocheck: persona-block-rationale` naming the role property that forces it — biber holds no OpenBao RBAC group by design, and the shared persona helper cannot drive OpenBao's method-select + popup + `postMessage` login. The administrator's OIDC journey is asserted instead by `test-oidc-login.js`, and biber's denial by `test-ldap-login.js`."
msgstr "[x] Tiga personas baseline ditutupi per [Kontrak drama](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): `guest` (tidak pernah mencapai sebuah permukaan terotentikasi), `biber`, `administrator`, masing-masing dalam sendiri `test-*.js` modul dikumpulkan oleh `playwright.spec.js`, dengan langkah SSO / LDAP dijaga oleh `skipUnlessServiceEnabled`. `guest` yang beredar dan terbenam, `biber` dan `administrator` diblokir dengan `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` di bawah kontrak yang didokumentasikan melarikan diri, masing-masing membawa `# nocheck: persona-block-rationale` nama properti peran yang memaksa - biber memegang tidak OpenBao RBAC group by design, and the shared persona helper can drive OpenBaometode - pilih + popup + `postMessage` login. Perjalanan administrator OIDC ditetapkan sebagai gantinya oleh `test-oidc-login.js`, dan biber penolakan oleh `test-ldap-login.js`."

