msgid "`biber` holds no EspoCRM role group, and every sign-in path admits only role-group members: with `sso` the role-group OIDC user provider refuses it, with LDAP only `ldapUserLoginFilter` refuses it, and without either no `biber` account exists. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. [`files/playwright/test-rbac.js`](./files/playwright/test-rbac.js) asserts the refusal and adds `biber` to the `user`, `manager` and `administrator` groups in turn to assert the rights each one grants. The `administrator` and `guest` personas run in every variant."
